  "generatedAt": "2026-10-05T02:26:59.683Z",
  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "This change adds a whole review subsystem to osf: a lens catalogue (20 shipped lenses plus repository overrides), a reviewer roster built from the agent list in `agents.rs`, a per-reviewer headless run that works in a clean copy of the change, quote verification of every finding against the real files, a deterministic reducer that turns answers into a verdict, and a `review.yml` workflow that fans reviewers out into separate jobs with only their own provider key and reduces their saved answers in a final job. It also reworks suppression so a marker is only judged unused by the checker that owns its rules, and adds `--no-suppress` for CI.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
